                "reviews": [
                    {
                        "recommendationid": "238698572",
                        "author": {
                            "steamid": "76561197997989295",
                            "num_reviews": 41,
                            "playtime_forever": 358,
                            "playtime_last_two_weeks": 358,
                            "playtime_at_review": 358,
                            "last_played": 1793128998
                        },
                        "language": "english",
                        "review": "I wanted this game, as the premise sounded like Sexy Brutale.\r\nIt was not really a game, more following people around for about an hour, and there are 7 characters, so allowing for multiple characters being in the same place, it took about 5 hours to see everything.\r\nThe story was good, I liked the general idea of the story.\r\nThe controls were good, allowing for quickly moving about and fast-forward and fast-rewinding of time.\r\nI didn't actually guess the murderer, but there were clues (I actually thought a key one was an error :) )\r\nI did have some technical issues at the start, with the game crashing (which was due to an issue affecting all games implemented with a specific version of unreal, but a solution was found on the discussion forums) and lack of sound, but making the window the formost window appeared to be the solution.",
